'' 'tiko test --message-format json': each test as events, the program's own output kept out of
'' the stream (out/test/output.log) -- a crashed test's event carries the end of it as "output".
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.tte/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.tte
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-crash => build/.tte/proj
'' ARGS: test -target windows-x86_64 build/.tte/proj --message-format json
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"test-plan","tests":4}
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"test-start","index":0,"name":"first passes",
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"test-end","index":0,"name":"first passes","status":"pass","ms":
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"test-end","index":1,"name":"ends the program","status":"crash","ms":
'' EXPECT-OUT: "exit":7
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"test-summary","passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"crashed":2,"timedOut":0,"ms":
'' EXPECT-OUT: (null pointer access) at line 14 of
'' EXPECT-NOT: running 4 tests
